### Health Checks

| ID | Type | Target | Expect | Timeout |
|----|------|--------|--------|---------|
| H1 | build | `{build command}` | exit 0 | 60s |
| H2 | endpoint | `GET {health path}` | status 200 | 5s |
| ... | browser | `{page path}` | no console errors | 10s |

### Detection Sources
- Build: {source}
- Health endpoint: {source}
- Browser targets: {source}
