#### Subagent Pipeline Phases (Route A)

```
Phase 0.5: Permission    → detect
Phase 0.7: Authenticity  → main session (dispatch surface preflight and evidence counters)
Phase 1: Planning        → planner (inline when the plan is one unit)
Phase 1.5: Test Scaffold → tester — skip if --skip-scaffold
