Priority order:
1. If `EFFORT` is set via `--effort` flag → keep it as the explicit override.
2. If `QUALITY` is set via `--quality` flag → use it. If invalid value, print error and stop.
3. Read `autopus.yaml` → `quality.providers.claude` → use the Claude provider override when present.
4. Otherwise read `autopus.yaml` → `quality.default` → use the global fallback (applies to both `--auto` and interactive modes).
