comments, or reordered quality fields can appear between keys. The Codex
provider override (`quality.providers.codex`) is independent and must not alter
this Claude dispatcher.

Quality mode is projected into each installed Claude agent definition as a
model-and-effort pair. Ordinary `Agent` calls omit effort and normally omit
model so the definition remains authoritative. A user-supplied per-run model
override is the only reason to send the optional `model` call field.

